REM scs_points - Windows build launcher.
REM
REM Copy this file to _VS2022.bat (which is git-ignored) and edit the paths, then
REM run it to open the solution in Visual Studio with the SDK location exported.
REM You MUST launch Visual Studio through this .bat (not by double-clicking the
REM .sln), so the variable below is present in the Visual Studio process and the
REM project can find sc_store.h and the libsc libraries.
REM
REM HVISUALIZE_WEB_INSTALL_DIR points at the root of the HOOPS Visualize Web SDK
REM (the folder that contains authoring\libsc). The project resolves headers and
REM libraries relative to this variable, so no absolute SDK path is stored in the
REM project file.
SET HVISUALIZE_WEB_INSTALL_DIR=Path\to\Communicator\HOOPS_Visualize_Web_2026.2.0

CALL "C:\Program Files\Microsoft Visual Studio\2022\Professional\Common7\IDE\devenv.exe" scs_points.sln
